flowchart TD
  A[PROTECTED HOLD] --> B[Collect Packet A: host and runner identity]
  B --> C{Packet A complete and hash verified?}
  C -- No / Unknown --> X[BLOCKED: request missing host evidence]
  C -- Yes --> D[Collect Packet B: GitHub sentinel execution]
  D --> E{runner_id > 0 and exact runner name?}
  E -- No / Unknown --> Y[BLOCKED: assignment not proven]
  E -- Yes --> F{Job assigned and steps instantiated?}
  F -- No / Unknown --> Y
  F -- Yes --> G{Sentinel exit code = 0?}
  G -- No / Unknown --> Z[REJECTED or BLOCKED: inspect raw evidence]
  G -- Yes --> H{Logs and artifacts retrievable?}
  H -- No / Unknown --> Z
  H -- Yes --> I[Correlate run, attempt, job, SHA, runner, timestamps]
  I --> J{Independent verifier accepts P1-P9?}
  J -- No / Unknown --> X
  J -- Yes --> K[G02 ACCEPTED]
  K --> L{Separate promotion authorization?}
  L -- No --> M[HOLD: production remains protected]
  L -- Yes --> N[Next gate review; no automatic promotion]
  X --> B
  Y --> D
  Z --> D
